{
  "title": "Dua during the Occultation of Imam Mahdi (a.t.f.s.) - SHORT اَللّٰهُمَّ عَرِّفْنِىْ نَفْسَكَ",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Shaykh al-Kulayni and others have reported that Imam al-Sadiq (a.s.) taught Zurarah to say this supplicatory prayer in the age of the occultation of Imam al-Mahdi (a.t.f.s.) and when the Shi’ah are exposed to tribulations:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ عَرِّفْنِىْ نَفْسَكَ\nALLAAHUMMA A’RRIFNEE NAFSAKA\nO Allah introduce Yourself to me \nفَاِنَّكَ اِنْ لَمْ تُعَرِّفْنِىْ نَفْسَكَ\nFA-INNAKA IN LAM TO-A’RRIFNEE NAFSAKA \nFor, if you do not introduce Yourself to me, \nلَمْ اَعْرِفْ نَبِيَّكَ\nLAM A-A’RIF NABIYYAKA\nI will not recognize Your Prophet (s.a.w.a.). \nاَللّٰهُمَّ عَرِّفْنِىْ رَسُوْلَكَ\nALLAAHUMMA A’RRIFNEE RASOOLAKA \nO Allah make me recognize Your Prophet (s.a.w.a.)\nفَاِنَّكَ اِنْ لَمْ تُعَرِّفْنِىْ رَسُوْلَكَ\nFA-INNAKA IN LAM TO-A’RRIFNEE RASOOLAKA \nbecause if I do not recognize Your Prophet (s.a.w.a.), \nلَمْ اَعْرِفْ حُجَّتَكَ\nLAM A-A’RIF HUJJATAKA \nI will not recognize Your Proof [Imam (a.s.)]. \nاَللّٰهُمَّ عَرِّفْنِىْ حُجَّتَكَ\nALLAAHUMMA A’RRIFNEE HUJJATAKA \nO Allah make me recognize Your Proof (a.t.f.s.)\nفَاِنَّكَ اِنْ لَمْ تُعَرِّفْنِىْ حُجَّتَكَ\nFA-INNAKA IN LAM TO-A’RRIFNEE HUJJATAKA \nFor, if you do not make me recognize Your Proof, \nضَلَلْتُ عَنْ دِيْنِىْ.\nZALALTO A’N DEENEE.\nI will deviate from my religion."
}
